in today's video we will be ranking  levi's top 10 fights in attack on titan  let's get started number 10 levi's  appearance  only a few episodes in we got to see  levi for the first time at that time he  was just a badass guy who had a talent  for killing titans at that time we  didn't know just how much we would grow  to love him the scene where we first got  to know levi was his very first fight  only a perfect fight could have  introduced him and in my opinion his  introductory fight definitely did him  justice i mean suddenly he went from the  rude guy we didn't notice to the guy we  wanted to know all about in this fight  levi appeared out of nowhere to save  aaron and let's be honest that happens a  lot in the anime doesn't it anyway aaron  gets defeated by two titans and is about  to get eaten when out of nowhere the one  and only captain levi shows up and gives  the titans a fight that they were  definitely not ready for it was a  jaw-dropping fight not only for us but  for aaron mikasa and armin as well  number nine levi meets irwin  [Music]  levi is the strongest soldier in the  survey corpse we all know that but how  did he end up there if you've watched  the bonus episodes about his past i'm  sure you know that but if you didn't go  watch them right now because his  backstory is definitely worth knowing  these bonus episodes also include one of  his best scenes the moment when he met  irwin smith i don't know about you but  since the start i always wondered why  levi respects and admires irwin so much  if you know levi you'll know he's the  kind of guy who does what he wants but  in front of irwin he never says no well  that's because when they first met irwin  actually saved levi's life levi and two  of his friends used to be criminals  living in the underground and in this  scene the survey corps including irwin  finally catch him however instead of  killing them or sending them to prison  irwin convinces levi to join them just  like all of us irwin was totally  impressed with levi's skills as well  irwin really didn't give him much of a  chance though but regardless we're all  thankful to irwin for making levi end up  with the survey corpse  number eight levi vs kenny round two  throughout the season levi was so  desperate to kill kenny and we were  cheering to see him dead so in this  scene he finally managed to get it done  levi's squad went into the caves to save  aaron and they had to fight kenny's  squad to do it the overall fight was  amazing but to add to it we saw a 1v1  between levi and kenny even though kenny  managed to trick levi at the start  obviously at the end of the day no fight  is too hard for levi he catches kenny by  surprise and severely injures him kenny  manages to escape but he later dies due  to his injuries number seven levi's big  decision you know what has to happen  airvin gets the shot  yeah most of levi's finest moments are  his fights but let's mention one moment  that isn't since this scene is probably  one of my favorite levi moments it was  when erwin and armin were both dying it  was so emotional and suspenseful that we  just couldn't keep our eyes off the  screen levi had the titan serum and he  had the option to save only one of them  obviously he wanted to save erwin but he  realized that that would only bring him  back to this cruel world and just like  all of us levi had tears in his eyes but  he decided to save armin did he make the  right decision it's up to you to decide  number six  levi vs beast titan round two  deep in the forest of giant trees zeke  manages to trick levi and escape his  imprisonment this led to yet another  thrilling fight between them which left  the beast titan defeated falling towards  zeke levi fires and hits zeke's nape  with four thunderspears before quickly  detonating them cutting zeke's mangled  and burned body from his titan form i  mean this time from the looks of it it  seemed like levi finally managed to kill  zeke obviously that wasn't the case but  this fight was still one of the finest  ones fought by captain levi  number 5 levi vs female titan  one of the first titan shifters we got  to see in the anime is the female titan  the first time it showed up we were all  confused and very scared it killed many  of levi's closest friends including his  personal squad it was a very sad moment  and to make it even sadder it ate aaron  as well thankfully he was in her mouth  and she didn't swallow him like many  other scenes levi comes in out of  nowhere to save aaron i mean it could be  a great drinking game just taking a shot  every time and ackerman swooped in to  save aaron although the female titan  attempts to fight back it begins to get  overwhelmed by the barrage of attacks  inflicted by levi allowing him to  incapacitate her while gaining the  chance to slice her titanform's mouth  and rescue aaron from within  number 4 entrance to liberio  yes getting to know more about marley  and its heroes in season 4 was great but  let's be honest it was like a breath of  fresh air when we finally got to see the  og characters and like many other scenes  this one was to save aaron as well shot  time and seeing levi after so long was  just incredible his entrance to liberia  was actually one of his finest moments  after the jaw titan sneaks behind and  jumps on aaron's back levi takes note  and goes to intercept it the jaw titan  tries to bite into the neck of the  attack titan but levi severs the muscles  in the left side of its face rendering  it unable to rip out the nape terrified  porco could just stand still and watch  as other soldiers started engaging him  as well  number 3 levi rage mode  among all levi's fights we don't really  get to see levi's emotions a lot he's  not an open person and he seems to keep  his emotions hidden he's always calm and  he calculates his every move but at this  moment he just couldn't levi was  separated from friends when they were  outside the walls without him furlon and  isabel died by getting eaten by a titan  levi went in complete rage mode slicing  the titan that killed them in over 100  pieces even though it was a sad scene it  was also one of his most stunning fights  number 2 levi vs kenny  this is basically the fight between  humanity's strongest soldier and the guy  who actually taught him all his skills  it was the first time kenny showed up  and we were all confused about who he  really was and to add to the confusion  levi was so pissed to see him it didn't  make any sense well obviously we later  found out the whole backstory and found  out kenny is his long-lost uncle who  actually taught levi everything he knows  about fighting and survival levi shoots  kenny by aiming with the bottle's  reflection and this shot hits the chair  kenny is holding but is still strong  enough to throw him back outside and  levi takes the opportunity to escape  this was probably one of the very few  fights where levi actually got injured  but even so he ends up with a win  number one levi vs beast titan  the top of our list is not just levi's  best scene but probably the most iconic  scene in the entire attack on titan  series the first fight between levi and  zeke i'm sure you all remember the first  time beast titan showed up we were all  scared of what kind of monster this was  i mean he threw rocks and killed so many  of our favorite characters whenever we  saw him it gave us goosebumps and we  just prayed no other character we loved  died and the worst part was it seemed  like no one could ever defeat this  monster but at the end of the day  nothing was impossible for captain levi  even the monstrous beast titan seemed to  be nothing in front of him this is one  of those fights that literally gives you  chills down your spine i mean the way  levi brought down a gigantic ape with  little to no effort man it was perfect i  don't know about you but this is one  attack on titan scene that i can never  get tired of and with that we come to  the end of this video i hope you enjoyed  the video and if you did make sure to  give it a big thumbs up and subscribe to  the channel and we'll see you guys next  time
 

